scope: "Cross-platform font unification — make the desktop Skia renderer draw text from the SAME pre-rendered bitmap font atlas the CYD ESP32 renderer uses, eliminating text rendering as the single largest source of cross-tier pixel divergence. Covers the atlas generator's second (JSON) output and its schema, the desktop BitmapFontAtlas module, the SkiaCanvas integration and its opt-in switch, the glyph blitting arithmetic that must match the firmware exactly, and the crosscheck wiring."
